<title>UK: Eurotunnel awarded UK telecoms licence.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel awarded UK telecoms licence.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurotunnel said on Thursday it had obtained a British licence as an international telecoms operator.</p>
<p>This followed last month's award by the French government to Eurotunnel of a telecom operator's licence for services provided to the public.</p>
<p>It said the two licences would allow the concessionaire of the Cross Channel Fixed Link to offer leased line services at very competitive prices, with immediate effect between London and Paris. At present, Eurotunnel is the only telecoms operator on the cross-Channel route.</p>
</text>
